  "layout": {
    "_comment": "Starter 3.0 instance layout. On upgrade from layout 2, every file under a retired folder that the installed release doesn't manage moves to its new folder: a hard link, then the old name removed, so bytes, size and mode never change. Longest matching 'from' wins; every retired folder has a catch-all. Planned and journaled before the first move; refused, changing nothing, on any existing destination, case or Unicode collision, symlink, nested repository or other disk. The quarantine names are set aside in the upgrade's backup, not moved. A website folder moves only after Vercel confirms no project still builds the old path.",
